'''Area 28''' (Japanese: '''エリア２８''' ''Area 28'') is an {{pkmn|animated series}}-exclusive location in the [[Unova]] [[region]]. It exists along {{rt|4|Unova}} and is notorious for {{wp|Unidentified flying objects|UFO}} sightings. 

[[Professor Icarus]] lived there after he quit his job as a university professor in order to work on ways to manipulate {{wp|dark matter}}. It was also where he encountered {{p|Elgyem}}, a Pokémon considered to be {{pkmn2|extraterrestrial}}.

Area 28 is largely desert, with one diner and Professor Icarus's laboratory the main points of interest. 

